1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,240
This is the implementation demo for journey one.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:08,090
Everything here is the real application and API running on this machine,

3
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:11,190
with a local mailbox that sends no real email.

4
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:16,450
It shows how a buyer creates an account, proves their email, signs in and out,

5
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,740
and recovers a forgotten password.

6
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,610
Start on the sign-up page.

7
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:24,520
With a short email and password and no name,

8
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:29,410
the page refuses and lists exactly what to fix, with focus on the summary.

9
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:30,730
Now a valid account.

10
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:33,240
The page asks you to check your email.

11
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:37,270
Signing in before you verify is refused, with a clear reason.

12
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:41,470
We open the emailed link, which proves the address,

13
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:43,800
and the page confirms you are verified.

14
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:48,630
A wrong password is rejected with a message that never says which part was wrong.

15
00:00:48,630 --> 00:00:51,740
The right password signs you in to your inspections.

16
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:57,180
Signing out asks first, because your inspections stay in your account.

17
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,200
Then the forgotten password path.

18
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:03,670
We ask for a link, which works for thirty minutes, choose a new password,

19
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:05,630
and the page signs you in again.

20
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:10,510
Mechanics and body shops register through the same door.

21
00:01:10,510 --> 00:01:14,980
A body shop registers and verifies, and can sign in as a body shop,

22
00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:17,710
but the response says it is not approved.

23
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:19,970
Registering never grants approval.

24
00:01:19,970 --> 00:01:24,570
And nobody can register as an administrator: that request is refused.

25
00:01:25,720 --> 00:01:27,530
Here is what to remember.

26
00:01:27,530 --> 00:01:30,870
Accounts need a verified email before sign in.

27
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:32,830
Links expire and work once.

28
00:01:32,830 --> 00:01:38,190
Providers wait for approval, and administrators cannot be self registered.

29
00:01:38,190 --> 00:01:42,040
Next, journey two: administering mechanics and shops.
